  m_text: "Bug Eater is released under the banner of 3 River Studios, a game studio
    affiliated with the University of Montana. Game design students worked over the
    course of 15 weeks to concept, design, develop, and release this demo. \r\n\r\nPlayers
    must eat bugs to get unique abilities and survive in the woods, avoiding lights
    placed by scientist who want to capture them.\r\n\r\nDamian Beardslee: 3D Art
    & Animation\r\nGarrett Boehm: Audio\r\nBridger Burkes: VFX Artist, Developer\r\nMint
    Pitassy: Producer, 2D Artist, Developer\r\nGreg Simmerman: Level Designer, Developer"
